| Table | Key fields | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `availability` | `candidate_id`, `date_start`, `date_end` | Layer 1 eligibility input |
| `family_exclusions` | `family_id`, `excluded_candidate_id`, `reason` | Hard exclusion logic |
| `certifications` | `candidate_id`, `visit_type`, `certified` | Role/certification match |
| `visit_history` | `visit_id`, `family_id`, `candidate_id`, `date`, `visit_type` | Feeds $R_{i,v}$, $F_{i,f}$, $C_{i,f}$ |
| `distance_matrix` | `candidate_id`, `family_id`, `distance_miles` | Feeds $D_{i,v}$ |
| `workload_period` | `candidate_id`, `period`, `visit_count` | Feeds $L_i$ |
| `family_continuity_flag` | `family_id`, `sigma`, `preferred_candidate_id` | Sets $\sigma_f$ and optional override |
| `scoring_weights` | `w1`, `w2`, `w3`, `w4`, `w5`, `effective_date` | Versioned scoring configuration |

